insert into public.quick_reference_sections (id,body,version)
values ('preop-documentation','Documentation prompts, not a validated clearance score:

- **Assessment:** Procedure/urgency, symptoms, calculated risk, functional capacity, and important risk modifiers.
- **Outstanding issues:** Additional testing or consultation, who will review results, and what findings would change the plan.
- **Medication/device plan:** Specific instructions, antithrombotic coordination, and any pacemaker/ICD arrangements.
- **Disposition:** Proceed with the agreed plan, obtain further evaluation, or defer elective surgery for optimization.
- **Communication:** Document the team’s risk-benefit discussion and the patient’s preferences.

These documentation prompts synthesize the assessment and team-planning principles in the [AHA/ACC perioperative guideline](https://www.ahajournals.org/doi/10.1161/CIR.0000000000001285) and [ASA preanesthesia standards](https://www.asahq.org/~/media/Sites/ASAHQ/Files/Public/Resources/standards-guidelines/basic-standards-for-preanesthesia-care.pdf); they are not a quoted or validated clearance checklist.','2026-09-27-audit1')
on conflict (id) do update set body=excluded.body,version=excluded.version,updated_at=now();

